              "title": "60-Day Clean Home Guarantee",
              "code": "<h3>60-Day Clean Home Guarantee</h3>\n\nWe stand behind the performance of our Spin Mop Dada. That’s why we offer a 60-Day Clean Home Guarantee—giving you 60 days from the date of delivery to request a return if you’re not satisfied with how it performs in your home.\n\nTo qualify for a return, you'll need to show that you've used the Spin Mop Dada as intended over the 60-day period (a quick video or a few photos will do), and provide your order confirmation or proof of purchase.\n\nPlease note: This guarantee excludes any accessories purchased separately from the Spin Mop Dada.\n\nTo initiate a return, email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@rene.ie\">support@rene.ie</a> and our team will be happy to help."
            }
          }
        },
